#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:1
#: c3733265a2d241eb897559db82659e72
msgid "From Research Question to Evidence: A Community-Hospital Efficiency Study"
msgstr "从研究问题到证据：一项社区医院效率研究"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:3
#: 18c7ec54e07f46329110e28eb2c8e3c2
msgid ""
"A regional health authority is preparing its annual service review. Forty-"
"eight community hospitals provide broadly similar inpatient and outpatient "
"care, yet their staffing and operating expenditure differ markedly. The "
"authority does not want a league table. It wants to know where current "
"services appear to be delivered with more resources than comparable practice"
" would require, which hospitals offer useful operational lessons, and which "
"conclusions remain credible when reasonable study choices are changed."
msgstr ""
"某地区卫生主管机构正在准备年度服务评审。48 "
"家社区医院提供大体相似的住院和门诊服务，但人员配置与运营支出差异显著。主管机构并不想制作排行榜，而是希望了解：哪些医院在提供现有服务时使用的资源似乎多于可比实践所需，哪些医院能够提供有用的运营经验，以及在合理改变研究选择后，哪些结论仍然可信。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:11
#: 457f9ac72ca2410caec0078a28c496d5
msgid ""
"This chapter follows that question from raw records to a decision-ready "
"result. The data are synthetic, so no real provider is being judged, but the"
" research choices are the ones an applied team must make: define the service"
" being studied, decide who is genuinely comparable, choose quantities that "
"have a defensible production meaning, estimate a primary model, examine "
"peers and improvement quantities, and test the findings against plausible "
"alternatives. The primary analysis is input-oriented BCC. VRS SBM, a broader"
" hospital roster, and the CCR--BCC scale comparison are used only to learn "
"how dependent the findings are on the first specification."
msgstr ""
"本章从原始记录出发，一直把这个问题推进到可供决策使用的结果。数据是合成的，所以没有评价任何真实服务机构；但研究选择与应用团队必须面对的完全相同：界定所研究的服务，判断哪些机构真正可比，选择具有可信生产含义的数量，估计主要模型，考察活跃参照单元与改进数量，并用合理的替代设定检验结论。主要分析采用投入导向"
" BCC。VRS SBM、更宽的医院名册和 CCR--BCC 规模比较只用于了解结果在多大程度上依赖初始设定。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:21
#: de25ebb59f4449829215eb58e9e02c90
msgid "Begin with the decision, not the score"
msgstr "从决策开始，而不是从得分开始"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:23
#: 58dafc0a0fc943d183e73423077fe5b9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The authority's immediate responsibility is resource stewardship. It must "
"protect the volume and quality of the services currently supplied while "
"asking whether staff and non-pay expenditure could be lower. That "
"responsibility leads to an input-oriented measure. Because community "
"hospitals differ in size and the study does not assume that every operating "
"pattern can be proportionally replicated, variable returns to scale is the "
"main assumption. Together these choices lead to BCC-I {cite:p}`banker1984`."
msgstr ""
"主管机构当前最直接的责任是审慎使用资源。它必须保障当前提供的服务数量与质量，同时考察人员和非工资性支出能否降低。这项责任对应投入导向测度。社区医院规模不同，研究也不假定每种经营模式都能按比例复制，因此主要采用规模报酬可变假设。两项选择合在一起得到"
" BCC-I {cite:p}`banker1984`。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:31
#: 65b81280b5d9413ea854921690a994e7
msgid ""
"For hospital $o$, the fitted value $\\theta_o$ is the smallest common share "
"of its three inputs needed to support at least its two current service "
"outputs within the observed opportunities of the comparison group. A value "
"of 0.90 therefore means that comparable practice supports the current "
"services with 90 percent of each input before any remaining input-specific "
"excess is considered. It does not mean that ten percent of every budget line"
" can be removed tomorrow. Actual savings depend on clinical constraints, "
"input-specific gaps, local costs, and the ability to adopt the practices "
"behind the comparison."
msgstr ""
"对医院 $o$，拟合值 $\\theta_o$ "
"表示：在比较组所代表的生产机会内，为至少支持其当前两项服务产出，三项投入共同需要保留的最小份额。因此，0.90 "
"表示，在考虑任何剩余逐项投入冗余之前，可比实践用每项投入的 90% 就能支持现有服务。它不表示明天可以从每条预算线削减 "
"10%。实际可节约多少取决于临床约束、逐项投入缺口、地方成本，以及能否采用比较背后的实践。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:40
#: d2f69c03e18d4885b465eca48acdf565
msgid "The management question fixes the roles of the five production variables:"
msgstr "管理问题确定了五个生产变量的角色："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 5cc413bd218344648d400727cbd28d2f
msgid "Role"
msgstr "角色"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: ee1989c5de604c98a760e61f2483e728
msgid "Quantity"
msgstr "数量"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: f455709b950944f0bb0f22186cc8b7e8
msgid "Why it belongs in the study"
msgstr "纳入研究的理由"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 3daa0eb1260347ee920631b55e39270d c80587eeb6514ad4a0fe00cf4f5d4c91
#: f9b9a966fd474e4c817786a9cef93818
msgid "Input"
msgstr "投入"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: add6daa3c36b4ebeb5eba80c3858d799
msgid "Clinical full-time-equivalent staff"
msgstr "临床全职当量人员"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 2fab60bea7f14109b352ea047a44fff3
msgid "Direct clinical labour committed to service delivery"
msgstr "直接用于提供服务的临床劳动"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 6b419f1a42354e5585c405aea6599703
msgid "Support full-time-equivalent staff"
msgstr "支持人员全职当量"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 54acf07077004691b8e56739a3c6e96d
msgid "Operational and administrative labour supporting care"
msgstr "支持医疗服务的运营与行政劳动"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: e426b0d0e9854c4fa172ae16f69e64a7
msgid "Non-pay operating expenditure, £ million"
msgstr "非工资性运营支出，百万英镑"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 6d64638a7c394513a4ca7c4ccc878d9a
msgid "Recurrent supplies and services used during the year"
msgstr "本年度使用的经常性物资与服务"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 2a2149f8309449c1a88d50a152cbe712 b083343593e749daa5c3159525ee56bc
msgid "Output"
msgstr "产出"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 422b65c3d947442b959632910e30eff1
msgid "Quality-adjusted discharges"
msgstr "质量调整后出院人次"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: d922e81807fd4f45b50b2fcc397d715d
msgid "Inpatient activity adjusted for case mix and a quality factor"
msgstr "按病例组合和质量因子调整的住院活动"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 72c3364e9ba449fca2aeed05a3e3c6a5
msgid "Outpatient encounters"
msgstr "门诊接诊人次"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md
#: 4e80bcbb8c8d48f2aec528cabf0d77fb
msgid "Ambulatory services completed during the year"
msgstr "本年度完成的门诊服务"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:50
#: 92f504807c6448b1a23ea60d2eb80247
msgid ""
"The quality adjustment is intentionally modest: it prevents a hospital from "
"looking productive merely because it records many discharges while receiving"
" no recognition for the quality dimension included in the data. It is still "
"only a summary measure. A real study would examine coding consistency, risk "
"adjustment, waiting times, readmissions, and other outcomes before treating "
"these hospitals as comparable."
msgstr "质量调整有意保持适度：它避免一家医院只因记录了大量出院人次、而数据中的质量维度完全不受重视，就显得生产率很高。但它仍只是一个汇总测度。真实研究在把这些医院视为可比之前，还应考察编码一致性、风险调整、等待时间、再入院和其他结果。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:56
#: 575b8c700c1d4ee0abf953d8369fc65c
msgid "Build the comparison group before seeing performance"
msgstr "在查看绩效之前建立比较组"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:58
#: f57822f6fc544fc5bacebdac2fd9417e
msgid ""
"The source file contains 64 hospitals for one financial year. Some records "
"are unsuitable for the main study because reporting is incomplete, activity "
"changed under a structural break, or the hospital has a specialist or "
"teaching-referral mission. Four district-general hospitals also have a "
"referral share between 15 and 25 percent. They are plausible comparators, "
"but their wider tertiary role may raise resource needs that are not fully "
"measured. The main study excludes them; a later sensitivity analysis admits "
"them."
msgstr ""
"源文件包含一个财政年度的 64 家医院。部分记录不适合主要研究，因为报告不完整、生产活动出现结构突变，或医院承担专科或教学转诊任务。另有 4 "
"家地区综合医院的转诊占比在 15% 至 25% 之间。它们可能是合理比较对象，但更广泛的三级诊疗角色可能带来尚未充分测量的额外资源需求。主要研究排除这 "
"4 家医院，之后的敏感性分析再将其纳入。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:86
#: ffa2c17e314b4cc4928a447b1efa9b09
msgid ""
"Screening is written as a sequence so that every exclusion can be counted "
"and reviewed. No efficiency estimate enters these rules."
msgstr "筛选过程写成明确步骤，使每项排除都可以计数和复核。任何效率估计都不会进入这些规则。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:115
#: 90ec169565be4c6abf3de16af91c9760
msgid ""
"Sixty-four raw hospital records become sixty usable records, fifty-two "
"district-general hospitals, and a forty-eight-hospital main comparison group"
msgstr "64 条医院原始记录依次筛为 60 条可用记录、52 家地区综合医院和 48 家医院的主要比较组"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:120
#: 34f5c168e6364dd287e2a067851944ea
msgid ""
"The study population narrows for substantive reasons before performance is "
"estimated. The four borderline-referral hospitals return only in a pre-"
"planned sensitivity analysis."
msgstr "在估计绩效之前，研究总体已经因实质性理由逐步收窄。4 家临界转诊医院只在预先规划的敏感性分析中重新加入。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:125
#: c89f9e82e070465b8fefb660e6de58ea
msgid ""
"This separation between a candidate roster and a comparison group matters "
"economically. A highly specialized hospital can make a district hospital "
"appear better or worse for reasons that reflect mission rather than "
"management. More observations do not automatically improve a DEA study; "
"observations improve the study only when they supply credible information "
"about attainable practice for the organizations being assessed."
msgstr ""
"候选名册与比较组的分离具有经济意义。高度专科化医院可能使地区医院显得更好或更差，但原因在于任务差异而非管理。增加观测并不会自动改善 DEA "
"研究；只有当观测能为被评价组织提供可信的可实现实践信息时，才真正改善研究。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:132
#: 0660602f0e5d4ff39f2cce3772ae2c51
msgid "Estimate the resource-stewardship comparison"
msgstr "估计资源使用责任比较"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:134
#: 531914705dcb4502ac0855c1a00e1b32
msgid ""
"The screened quantities are now assembled into `DEAData`. The resulting "
"table contains 48 hospitals, three inputs, and two outputs. With five "
"production dimensions, the sample is large enough for a useful worked "
"example, although no universal sample-size formula can replace an "
"examination of comparability and discriminating power."
msgstr ""
"现在把筛选后的数量组织为 `DEAData`。所得数据表包含 48 家医院、3 项投入和 2 "
"项产出。五个生产维度下，这个样本足以支持有用的示例研究；不过，任何通用样本量公式都不能取代对可比性与区分能力的考察。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:162
#: 1e09ad63eb6a4c3d82361d3db1b50a5c
msgid ""
"Distribution and ordered hospital values for input-oriented BCC efficiency "
"in the forty-eight-hospital main comparison group"
msgstr "48 家医院主要比较组中投入导向 BCC 效率的分布与医院排序值"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:167
#: a0c64e77dd5b45c1b4c13fba907a3ca5
msgid ""
"Most hospitals lie relatively near observed best practice, but the variation"
" is large enough to separate modest review priorities from substantial ones."
" A value of one means that this sample and specification reveal no supported"
" input saving; it is not proof that the hospital has no waste."
msgstr ""
"多数医院相对接近观测到的最佳实践，但差异足以区分一般评审对象与应优先关注的对象。得分为 1 "
"表示在这个样本与设定下，没有发现可以支持的投入节约；它并不能证明医院不存在浪费。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:173
#: c1da2304168e4099a6aa04f1c385af0b
msgid ""
"The median hospital retains 96.3 percent of its input bundle in the common "
"proportional comparison. Twelve hospitals score one, while the lowest score "
"is 0.831. This is useful portfolio information: the authority can "
"distinguish hospitals that warrant an early operational review from those "
"for which the current model finds little scope. It should not publish the "
"values as an unqualified ranking. Differences may also reflect omitted case "
"severity, local labour markets, estate constraints, or measurement error."
msgstr ""
"中位医院在共同比例比较中保留 96.3% 的投入组合。12 家医院得分为 1，最低得分为 "
"0.831。这些信息有助于组合管理：主管机构可以区分应当较早接受运营评审的医院，与当前模型认为改进空间较小的医院。但不应把这些数值作为无条件排序发布。差异还可能反映遗漏的病例严重程度、地方劳动力市场、设施约束或测量误差。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:181
#: 41e424ad7407484c81a75550d0ab3c9a
msgid "Turn one score into an operational inquiry"
msgstr "把一个得分转化为运营调查"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:183
#: 2b11391f131f46ad85bd7e8b304af022
msgid ""
"Hospital H048 provides a transparent example. Its two service quantities "
"match H008, while its clinical staff, support staff, and non-pay expenditure"
" are 18, 12, and 15 percent higher. The BCC-I score is therefore 0.893. H008"
" is the sole selected peer, with weight one."
msgstr ""
"医院 H048 是一个清楚的例子。其两项服务数量与 H008 相同，但临床人员、支持人员和非工资性支出分别高出 18%、12% 和 "
"15%。因此，BCC-I 得分为 0.893。H008 是唯一选中的活跃参照单元，权重为 1。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:203
#: d32061f7908b46b493dd304d690cf09e
msgid ""
"H048 uses H008 as its peer and has supported reductions in clinical staff, "
"support staff, and non-pay operating expenditure while preserving both "
"service quantities"
msgstr "H048 以 H008 为活跃参照单元；在保障两项服务数量的同时，证据支持减少临床人员、支持人员和非工资性运营支出"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:208
#: d78b1b18d9c74830bada9afb44d0a649
msgid ""
"H048's common proportional resource-retention value is 89.3 percent. "
"Completing the comparison yields input-specific reductions of 15.3 percent "
"in clinical staff, 10.7 percent in support staff, and 13.0 percent in non-"
"pay expenditure, while both service quantities are preserved."
msgstr ""
"H048 的共同资源保留比例为 89.3%。补全比较后，临床人员、支持人员和非工资性支出分别可以减少 15.3%、10.7% 和 "
"13.0%，同时保障两项服务数量。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:214
#: 68fc3a9c92b0406dacfa6433b6776ca5
msgid ""
"This result gives the review team a place to start asking questions. It can "
"examine how H008 organizes rotas, outpatient pathways, procurement, and "
"clinical support; verify whether the two hospitals face similar case "
"severity and access duties; and identify which practices are transferable. "
"H008 is evidence that the quantities are jointly attainable in this dataset,"
" not an instruction to copy its organization. The target is likewise a "
"feasible benchmark for investigation, not next year's budget. Staff "
"indivisibilities, safety requirements, adjustment costs, and local knowledge"
" belong in the decision that follows."
msgstr ""
"这一结果为评审团队提供了调查起点。团队可以考察 H008 "
"如何安排值班、门诊路径、采购和临床支持，核验两家医院是否面对相似的病例严重程度与服务可及性责任，并判断哪些实践可以移植。H008 "
"是这些数量在本数据集中联合可实现的证据，不是照搬其组织方式的指令。目标方案同样是用于调查的可行标杆，并非下一年度预算。人员不可分割性、安全要求、调整成本和地方知识都应进入随后的决策。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:223
#: 15a325b2e4e7446a8f061a66d4567dbe
msgid "Learn which conclusions survive alternative readings"
msgstr "了解哪些结论经得起其他合理解释"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:225
#: 7857ba39d5614d4f82288ccce665bd92
msgid ""
"A single preferred specification should be accompanied by alternatives that "
"answer recognizably different but relevant questions. Sensitivity analysis "
"is most useful when each alternative has a substantive reason; cycling "
"through dozens of models until one produces an attractive result is not "
"evidence."
msgstr "首选设定应当配有回答不同但相关问题的替代设定。只有每个替代设定都有实质性理由时，敏感性分析才最有价值；在几十个模型之间循环，直到某个结果看起来吸引人，并不构成证据。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:230
#: 43188c27995748f18ab05a66a3b20bbb
msgid "Are the resource gaps uneven across inputs?"
msgstr "不同投入的资源缺口是否不均衡？"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:232
#: 0911ef3010aa42a7872963538387433e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The radial score begins with a common percentage reduction. VRS SBM gives "
"more weight to input- and output-specific gaps relative to each hospital's "
"own quantities {cite:p}`tone2001`. It is a demanding secondary reading when "
"managers suspect that excess resources are concentrated rather than "
"proportional."
msgstr ""
"径向得分从共同百分比压缩开始。VRS SBM 则更重视各家医院自身数量下逐项投入与产出缺口的比例 "
"{cite:p}`tone2001`。当管理者怀疑资源过量集中在部分投入而非同比例出现时，它是一项要求更高的辅助解读。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:249
#: a67ce43696504e34b164b7d2ad349520
msgid ""
"Across the 48 hospitals, the two readings are strongly associated "
"(correlation 0.905), and the same twelve hospitals score one. Yet H048 falls"
" from 0.893 to 0.852, because its resource gaps are not uniform. The BCC "
"result remains the primary answer to the authority's proportional "
"stewardship question; SBM adds a warning that one percentage alone "
"understates the unevenness of H048's improvement opportunities."
msgstr ""
"在 48 家医院中，两种解读高度相关（相关系数 0.905），且同样有 12 家医院得分为 1。但 H048 从 0.893 降至 "
"0.852，因为其资源缺口并不均匀。BCC 结果仍是主管机构“按比例审慎使用资源”问题的主要答案；SBM 则提醒，一个百分比低估了 H048 "
"改进机会的不均衡程度。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:255
#: 12f1d5873faa429ab3090af5691a0fcd
msgid "Does the comparison group change the finding?"
msgstr "改变比较组会改变结论吗？"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:257
#: 8244b3eb1604464c8c5313b7b237bc75
msgid ""
"The wider roster admits the four district-general hospitals with tertiary "
"referral shares between 15 and 25 percent. Nothing about the focal 48 "
"hospitals changes; only the set of practices allowed to inform their "
"comparison becomes wider."
msgstr "更宽的名册纳入转诊占比在 15% 至 25% 之间的 4 家地区综合医院。作为评价对象的 48 家医院没有任何变化；只有允许用来构造比较的实践集合扩大了。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:282
#: cbfbe9f0b5164854b9dbd8243956db74
msgid ""
"Main and broad comparison-group BCC efficiency values for the same forty-"
"eight hospitals, with H048 highlighted"
msgstr "同一组 48 家医院在主要比较组和宽比较组下的 BCC 效率，其中突出显示 H048"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:287
#: 04edda894c43468a9c28dbceda5b8526
msgid ""
"Admitting four hospitals with a larger referral role makes the benchmark "
"more demanding for 42 of the 48 main hospitals. H048 moves from 0.893 to "
"0.865. The direction is informative, but whether the wider result is more "
"credible depends on whether referral complexity has been adequately "
"measured."
msgstr ""
"纳入 4 家承担更多转诊任务的医院，使 48 家主要医院中的 42 家面对要求更高的标杆。H048 从 0.893 降至 "
"0.865。变化方向具有信息价值，但更宽结果是否更可信，取决于是否充分测量了转诊复杂性。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:293
#: e9ec49b6ed19481db7b5a3ffca4f0159
msgid ""
"The average change is 3.3 percentage points and the largest is 7.8 points. "
"That is large enough to report. It also sharpens the research priority: "
"collect better information on tertiary workload before deciding whether "
"those four hospitals belong in the main comparison. A stricter list is not "
"automatically fairer, and a wider list is not automatically more "
"informative."
msgstr ""
"平均变化为 3.3 个百分点，最大变化为 7.8 个百分点，幅度已大到必须报告。这也使研究重点更加明确：在判断这 4 "
"家医院是否应进入主要比较组之前，应收集更好的三级诊疗工作量信息。更严格的名单并不会自动更公平，更宽的名单也不会自动包含更多有效信息。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:299
#: be190fc456ff44e4ac1c18566dfc07ee
msgid "How much of the gap is associated with scale assumptions?"
msgstr "有多少差距与规模假设有关？"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:301
#: 3036e9efa388425a8ac2648bfe9ce88b
msgid ""
"Finally, the CCR--BCC ratio compares the input-oriented CRS and VRS results."
" It asks how much additional shortfall appears when proportional replication"
" is permitted, beyond the resource-use gap already observed under VRS."
msgstr "最后，CCR--BCC 比率比较投入导向 CRS 与 VRS 结果。它考察：在 VRS 已识别的资源使用缺口之外，允许按比例复制又增加了多少绩效差距。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:315
#: 81e26d611ce9489684511eb6841f2c1b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For H048, CRS efficiency is 0.860, VRS efficiency is 0.893, and their ratio "
"is 0.963. Across the sample the median ratio is 0.962. These values show "
"that the CRS assumption adds a material gap for some hospitals. They do not "
"tell management to expand, merge, or shrink a hospital. Such choices require"
" local returns-to-scale evidence, demand forecasts, access objectives, fixed"
" costs, and the feasibility of changing capacity. The scale chapter develops"
" that interpretation in {doc}`scale-performance-management`."
msgstr ""
"对 H048，CRS 效率为 0.860，VRS 效率为 0.893，二者之比为 0.963；样本中位比率为 0.962。这些数值表明，CRS "
"假设会给部分医院增加实质性差距。它们并没有告诉管理层应当扩张、合并还是缩小医院。此类选择还需要局部规模报酬证据、需求预测、可及性目标、固定成本和产能调整可行性。{doc"
"}`scale-performance-management` 一章详细讨论了这种解释。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:323
#: 12a718eca04b4c318ec5c846f17fba7b
msgid "Prepare evidence for a management review"
msgstr "为管理评审准备证据"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:325
#: 9f5adfdbf9d64d2a91584d01da1a5187
msgid ""
"The quantitative study should end in a structured review, not in a "
"spreadsheet of scores. For each priority hospital the authority can "
"assemble:"
msgstr "定量研究应以结构化评审结束，而不是止于一张得分表。对每家优先医院，主管机构可以汇集："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:328
#: 322822224c3c4ac38813100f356d19bf
msgid "the primary score and the service commitments protected by it;"
msgstr "主要得分及其保障的服务责任；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:329
#: 9206746bd3c741539a06d71d6d3c6ae0
msgid ""
"input-specific quantities, with physical units and realistic adjustment "
"periods;"
msgstr "按物理单位表示、并附现实调整期限的逐项投入数量；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:330
#: c3af3d940c6749389e97afa30abad39a
msgid ""
"selected peers, together with checks on mission, case mix, quality, and "
"local operating conditions;"
msgstr "所选活跃参照单元，以及对任务、病例组合、质量和地方经营条件的核查；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:332
#: 96548ef00caf4fefa61d337fd68ed702
msgid "results under the SBM, wider-roster, and CRS alternatives;"
msgstr "SBM、宽名册和 CRS 替代设定下的结果；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:333
#: a28a1beeccad45af98bf50612842a506
msgid ""
"data-quality concerns and important activities still omitted from the study;"
" and"
msgstr "数据质量问题与研究仍遗漏的重要活动；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:334
#: d9dd796e11844e698003482a562ca678
msgid ""
"questions for managers and clinicians about why practice differs and what "
"can be transferred safely."
msgstr "向管理者和临床人员提出的问题：实践为何不同，哪些内容可以安全移植。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:337
#: 2cb8b6833fee4b599536c5e57682567e
msgid ""
"DEAPack can package the fitted tables and available figures into one "
"reproducible file. The bundle is useful for review and replication; the "
"surrounding narrative must still explain the health-service meaning of every"
" result."
msgstr "DEAPack 可以把拟合表和可用图形打包成一个可复现文件。该包便于评审与复现，但配套叙述仍须解释每项结果在卫生服务中的含义。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/community-hospital-capstone.md:350
#: 9231fed332b24c1388815d350ab1bf38
msgid ""
"The main conclusion is deliberately conditional. Within a pre-specified "
"group of 48 district-general hospitals, and for the three resources and two "
"services in this study, observed practice supports meaningful resource-"
"saving opportunities for a number of providers. H048 is a clear review "
"candidate, but both its score and the size of its shortfall change under "
"reasonable alternative readings. The responsible next step is therefore a "
"focused operational investigation and better information on referral "
"complexity—not an automatic budget reduction."
msgstr ""
"主要结论刻意保持条件性。在预先规定的 48 家地区综合医院组内，并针对本研究的 3 项资源和 2 "
"项服务，观测实践支持若干服务机构存在有意义的资源节约机会。H048 "
"是明确的优先评审对象，但其得分和缺口大小都会在合理的替代解读下变化。因此，负责任的下一步是有针对性的运营调查，并收集更好的转诊复杂性信息，而不是自动削减预算。"

